that the patient would be experiencing normally, but without the fluctuations that we know trigger the symptoms. And so we recently, my laboratory recently published a really practical guide, how to guide for the use of GNRH agonis in the treatment of PMDD to generate agonists are the medications that are used to provoke this chemical menopause. So we wrote out of a very detailed explanation in the hopes

